# Issue tracking

Open work for this project is tracked as GitHub issues on `flyingkingbee/BruceLeeRemake`. Read the list with `gh issue list -R flyingkingbee/BruceLeeRemake` when you need to know what is still open.

Ask the user before you add a new issue. Name the title and say what it would cover, then wait for a yes. A follow-up you find while working is a suggestion until the user agrees to it. The repository is public, so its issues are public too.

When a commit fixes an open issue, put "Fixes #N" in the drafted commit message, so the push closes it.
